3. Not a console

   This software simulates a tank monitoring console for training and testing
   only. It does not monitor real tanks, lines or sensors, and nothing it
   shows is a reading from real equipment. Do not use it to make decisions
   about real equipment, compliance, leak detection or the environment. It is
   not a substitute for a real console or for the manufacturer's
   documentation.

